    "driftNotCanonized": [
      "Amber still appears outside the Reserved Amber Rule in the build: current-tab underline, wordmark square (app shell and public bar), :focus-visible outline, ::selection, input focus ring and caret, the shown-once key/invite panel (.reveal, .key), and the admin 'new' tag. Not recorded as system rules.",
      "Amber 2px focus outline on paper is about 2:1 contrast, below the 3:1 non-text minimum.",
